\begin{defn}
A !!{structure}~$\Struct{M}$ for $\Lang{L_A}$ is \emph{non-standard}
if it is not isomorphic to~$\Struct{N}$. The !!{element}s $x \in
\Domain{M}$ which are equal to $\Value{\num{n}}{M}$ for some $n \in
