\begin{defn}
!!^a{structure}~$\Struct{M}$ for $\Lang{L_A}$ is \emph{computable} iff
  $\Domain{M} = \Nat$ and $\Assign{\prime}{M}$, $\Assign{+}{M}$,
  $\Assign{\times}{M}$ are computable functions and $\Assign{<}{M}$ is
